{"overview":"در دنیایی که بر پایهٔ طبقه‌بندی، خشونت و مردانگی سمی شکل گرفته، دو دوست دوران کودکی در روستای تامیل نادو به هم پیوسته بزرگ می‌شوند. زندگی‌شان توسط ورود دوروتی، زنی که با شفقت‌اش به آرامی دنیای اطرافشان را به چالش می‌کشد، متحول می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Set in a world shaped by caste, violence, and toxic masculinity, two childhood friends grow up inseparable in rural Tamil Nadu. Their lives are transformed by the arrival of Dorothy, a woman whose compassion quietly challenges the world around them.","tagline_en":"","runtime":146,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Karthik Subbaraj"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IN"],"cast":[{"name":"Sananth","role":"Subbu / Dorothy","photo":"/mh9EbVubRHF1ZXHrO3mvIUcz3fS.jpg"},{"name":"Rishikanth","role":"Karthik","photo":"/io9H89WkkCSeAOhoIB4nThQGTuL.jpg"},{"name":"کرتی سورش","role":"Dorothy","photo":"/fTdgSinsAitdujBBEUEA72GY0pv.jpg","en":"Keerthy Suresh"},{"name":"Jeeva Subramanian","role":"","photo":"/irAhCy0p7EY8W4igSgt5GAB1EPC.jpg"},{"name":"Ramachandran Durairaj","role":"","photo":"/mKRBlyR34cK6grx8G1gr9YXlaZR.jpg"},{"name":"Muthukumar","role":"Whistle Veeraiya","photo":"/oPaJbhh6FqbotLju84LDlZ6ymhu.jpg"},{"name":"Soundara Raja","role":"Kalai","photo":"/jJz2TfCRLkJVnqfuQ9L9pGpHBOf.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Daasan","role":"Self","photo":"/cmaCIIuwAEr8Zasi5rvtpUQzwVe.jpg"},{"name":"Varun","role":"Subbu (Young)","photo":""},{"name":"Thihaan","role":"Karthik (young)","photo":""},{"name":"Rajeshwari","role":"Karthik mother","photo":""},{"name":"Gajaraj","role":"Parotta Master","photo":"/gCne3VndSODoFuqAfmW4xxizSty.jpg"}],"trailer":"xh14FVEUcDA","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1578079"}